  "body": "[Navigation Timing](http://w3c.github.io/navigation-timing/) has various phrases like\n\n> the time immediately before the user agent sets the current document readiness of the current document to \"complete\"\n\nand\n\n> a time value equal to the time when the load event of the current document is completed\n\nWe should have the HTML Standard define those moments within the relevant algorithms, so NT can just defer to it.\n\nCC @plehegar\n",
